<title>USA: Sundstrand Corp Q1 net, sales rise.</title>
<headline>Sundstrand Corp Q1 net, sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKFORD, Ill. 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			$  0.58		   $ 0.47</p>
<p> Net			 35,000		   26,000</p>
<p> Sales		    389,000		  368,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  60,200		   61,600</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q1 excludes restructuring charges of $3 million or $0.05 a share.</p>
